  "limitations": "The moment condition is sufficient rather than necessary. The Caratheodory cardinality bound is not claimed optimal. The six-dimensional icosahedral obstruction is sharper only below fourth moment 9/5. For symmetric Beta(a,a) with a>1, eventual incompatibility is proved without an exact dimensional threshold. The Phillips preprint is very recent and its full text was not retrievable in this run, leaving a residual comparison risk beyond its abstract.",
